    },
    {
      "id": "b-338",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-339",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-346",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-340",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Store **API keys as hashes** (Argon2)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-341",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Enforce **per-app rate limits** & **burst caps**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-342",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Validate `schemas.schema.rules` with a small DSL (only `role in [...]`, `true/false`)—no user-supplied JS."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-343",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Disallow cross-app relations; `relation.target` is virtual within same app."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-344",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "File uploads scanned by size/type; enforce `filesMB` quota per app."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-345",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Admin actions audited; **schema changes require tenant owner or super-admin**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-347",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-348",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```mermaid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-349",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "erDiagram"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-350",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "users ||--o{ app_memberships : member"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-351",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "apps  ||--o{ app_memberships : has"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-352",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "apps  ||--o{ schemas : has"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-353",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "schemas ||--o{ pv_records : shapes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-354",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "apps  ||--o{ pv_records : owns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-355",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "apps  ||--o{ api_keys : has"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-356",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "apps  ||--o{ pv_audits : logs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-357",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-358",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-359",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 1 (2–3 wks)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-363",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-360",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Migrations above, auth tagging, `apps/schemas` CRUD in Admin UI."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-361",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Gateway skeleton with guards + list/create for 1 table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-362",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`validate-schemas` and `status` scripts."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-364",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 2 (3–4 wks)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-367",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-365",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Full `pv_records` CRUD, validation/compiler, board flows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-366",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Realtime topics & presence, basic rate limiting."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-368",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 3 (2–3 wks)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-371",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-369",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tenant/App-user UIs (tables, forms, files), audit viewer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-370",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Membership invites and role management."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-372",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 4 (3–4 wks)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-375",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-373",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "External REST, webhooks, optimistic concurrency, indexing hints."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-374",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Analytics & per-app metrics; API key scopes."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-376",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 5 (2–3 wks)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-378",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-377",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pen-test pass, backup/restore, migration docs, beta cohort."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-379",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-383",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-380",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cross-app joins (for sanity, don’t)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-381",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User-defined code execution (no lambdas yet; use webhooks to your own infra)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-382",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Rich query language (start with filters; add compiled indexes if needed)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-384",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-389",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-385",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don’t overfit to “real PocketBase clone.” Your **win** is *tenant isolation + DX*, not 1:1 parity."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-386",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Keep the schema rule DSL tiny; that’s your blast-radius control."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-387",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Make `status` authoritative—treat “Syncing” as a lock to serialize side-effects."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-388",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ship seeds early; they’ll expose quota, perf, and rule gaps immediately."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-390",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you want, I can turn this into a runnable starter (gateway scaffolding + migrations + seed scripts) next."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}